    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/3e61b56b9496a9716cd586d97fe98327.avif?t=1749464094\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/14179b08dd6f02b7852587d15e93976b.avif?t=1749464094\" /></span>Discover long-lost secrets and forbidden powers hidden within its dark corners, and forge your path through a mystery land of hell. As you traverse these infernal realms, beware of the dangers: Hell\u2019s dark forces and ancient creatures stand ready to test your might. Each layer holds its own mysteries and challenges, pushing you to your limits and rewarding those brave enough to uncover the hidden powers.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/41ce579ea2ac28af98c023508476322b.poster.avif?t=1749464094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/41ce579ea2ac28af98c023508476322b.webm?t=1749464094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/41ce579ea2ac28af98c023508476322b.mp4?t=1749464094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/ef6cc1b5d55421c5948226d2aba37f8c.avif?t=1749464094\" /></span>As a &quot;<strong>Dumbriel</strong>&quot; you will engage in fast-paced, strategic combat that rewards both precision and creativity. With a vast arsenal of abilities and spells. You can shape &quot;<strong>Dumbriel</strong>&quot;\u2019s journey in ways that reflect your own playstyle. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/a18b2607c77fb494933100082e289efc.poster.avif?t=1749464094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/a18b2607c77fb494933100082e289efc.webm?t=1749464094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/a18b2607c77fb494933100082e289efc.mp4?t=1749464094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/ea62284d0400470d106cf67a732c3ab7.avif?t=1749464094\" /></span>Join &quot;<strong>Dumbriel</strong>&quot;\u2019s journey through the depths of Hell, where survival is just the beginning. As you navigate the layers of the underworld, help &quot;<strong>Dumbriel</strong>&quot; unravel the secrets that lurk within each hellish realm. Meet NPC allies who will guide you, and aid you in your quest for freedom. Together, solve ancient riddles, and uncover the mysteries hidden in Hell. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/53bd3da81da09541dfcb89a6133dab64.poster.avif?t=1749464094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/53bd3da81da09541dfcb89a6133dab64.webm?t=1749464094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/53bd3da81da09541dfcb89a6133dab64.mp4?t=1749464094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/a73be902fa72327d04863fd585bc4cdf.avif?t=1749464094\" /></span>&quot;<strong>Dumbriel</strong>&quot;\u2019s bosses include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-phase Fights</strong>: As bosses grow more desperate, they change their tactics, adding layers of difficulty that keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalities with Purpose</strong>: Each boss isn't just a random enemy but a meaningful part of <strong>Dumbriel</strong>'s world, with its own backstory and place in the lore.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/9350fbe1b1e61a48b5284c8bd4242a39.poster.avif?t=1749464094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/9350fbe1b1e61a48b5284c8bd4242a39.webm?t=1749464094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/9350fbe1b1e61a48b5284c8bd4242a39.mp4?t=1749464094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/58f0a4cc2184156e00587928e46f1940.avif?t=1749464094\" /></span>Every area in &quot;<strong>Dumbriel</strong>&quot; is designed to feel meaningful and connected, offering rich lore and secrets waiting to be uncovered. With each new ability or item, players will unlock previously unreachable areas, pushing exploration to the heart of the game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/02680f9c40ff25a84716b8b319a8fcdb.poster.avif?t=1749464094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/02680f9c40ff25a84716b8b319a8fcdb.webm?t=1749464094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500690/extras/02680f9c40ff25a84716b8b319a8fcdb.mp4?t=1749464094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
